<section><div class="sectionhead"><h2>Where players stop</h2><p>Last seen ≠ confirmed abandonment. A player may return later.</p></div><div class="tablewrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Lap</th><th>Plays reaching it</th><th>Falls after this lap</th><th>Last seen here*</th><th>Reach</th></tr></thead><tbody><?php foreach($r['laps'] as $i=>$lap):?><tr><td><?=$i+1?></td><td><?=$lap['reached']?></td><td><?=$lap['falls']?></td><td><?=$lap['last']?></td><td><meter min="0" max="<?=max(1,$plays)?>" value="<?=$lap['reached']?>"></meter></td></tr><?php endforeach;?></tbody></table></div><small>* Unfinished plays with no update for over two minutes. Falls are grouped by the last grounded stair lap, not an exact collision coordinate.</small></section>
<section><div class="sectionhead"><h2>Approximate player locations</h2><p>IP-based estimates · no browser location permission</p></div><div class="tablewrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Country</th><th>Region, when available</th><th>Unique browsers</th><th>Plays</th><th>Falls</th><th>Finished</th><th>Climbed</th></tr></thead><tbody><?php foreach($r['locations'] as $location):?><tr><td><?=e($location['country_name']??'Unknown')?></td><td><?=e($location['region']??'—')?></td><td><?=$fmt($location['unique_players'])?></td><td><?=$fmt($location['plays'])?></td><td><?=$fmt($location['falls'])?></td><td><?=$fmt($location['completions'])?></td><td><?=$fmt($location['climbed_m'])?> m</td></tr><?php endforeach;?></tbody></table></div><small>Estimated by the hosting server from the connection IP. VPNs, proxies and mobile networks can show another location. No raw IP, city or coordinates are stored in analytics. Older or unresolved visits appear as Unknown. A browser can appear in more than one location across visits. Location details are included in the private JSON export.</small></section>
<div class="columns"><section><h2>Mobile vs desktop</h2><div class="tablewrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Platform</th><th>Plays</th><th>Falls</th><th>Finished</th><th>Rate</th></tr></thead><tbody><?php foreach($r['platforms'] as $platform=>$p):?><tr><td><?=e(ucfirst($platform))?></td><td><?=$fmt($p['plays'])?></td><td><?=$fmt($p['falls'])?></td><td><?=$fmt($p['completions'])?></td><td><?=$p['plays']?round(100*$p['completions']/$p['plays'],1):0?>%</td></tr><?php endforeach;?></tbody></table></div></section>
